I think the main issue is what DSM would you wear if you already had
reflection and MR (from quest artifacts, CoMR, shield of reflection,
etc).  Obviously, reflection and MR are top priorities for any
character.  If you already have those two, then you should be able to
get one of the "cool side effects" from another type of armor.

That being said, I think acid resistance fills this slot for yellow
dragons nicely already, being one of those useless yet cool
intrinsics.  As other posters have said, hallucination resistance,
blinding resistance, or extra damage or AC would be other good ideas
for DSM.
 
